*** Forward Conduction Model ***
Gds D s2 Value {V(Fwd)}
Eds Fwd 0 Value {AFm*IdFwd(V(D,s2),V(G,S)-Vths/(1+max(V(G,S)-10,0)**3)+VthFwd(V(Tj)))}
